        ⚠ AMENDED 2026-08-14 (Phase 3, observation 5). THE CONTRAST ABOVE IS NOW FALSE. THE RULE
        IT ILLUSTRATES IS UNCHANGED, CORRECT, AND NOW APPLIES MORE WIDELY THAN WHEN IT WAS
        WRITTEN.
        =====================================================================

